(7543091, 1207308, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not judging the title but this photo is better without it. The "wonder" here is just momentary, accidental, and that''s what''s beautiful about it.</td>', 'I''m not judging the title but this photo is better without it. The "wonder" here is just momentary, accidental, and that''s what''s beautiful about it.', '2017-11-07 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543092, 1207276, 50695, '<td valign="top">great catch</td>', 'great catch', '2017-11-07 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543093, 1207582, 50695, '<td valign="top">stunning photo but I think the processing is overdone. the photo is already magical. the processing makes it feel like you''re trying too hard. It''s great to try hard but it should look effortless.</td>', 'stunning photo but I think the processing is overdone. the photo is already magical. the processing makes it feel like you''re trying too hard. It''s great to try hard but it should look effortless.', '2017-11-07 14:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
