(7543348, 1207589, 185755, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> You''ve captured a sadness that she may not even have been feeling, or didn''t know she was feeling. But it is through her and all around her.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your kind comment. I''ve been watching her .. after feeding the birds , she walked away calmly. Maybe she has some sad thoughts on her mind.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: You''ve captured a sadness that she may not even have been feeling, or didn''t know she was feeling. But it is through her and all around her. I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery    Thank you for your kind comment. I''ve been watching her .. after feeding the birds , she walked away calmly. Maybe she has some sad thoughts on her mind.', '2017-11-08 04:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
